OL,3,AHome secretary hits out at
OL,4,A'unacceptable' migrant landings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Secretary has said migrant
OL,7,Flandings on UK beaches are "not
OL,8,Facceptable", as she ordered an urgent
OL,9,Freview after two boats reached Kent
OL,10,Fwithout being intercepted.
OL,12,FShabana Mahmood told Border Security
OL,13,FCommand to carry out the review after
OL,14,Fvessels came ashore at Samphire Hoe,
OL,15,Fbetween Dover and Folkestone, on
OL,16,FTuesday, and near Folkestone on Monday.
OL,18,FTwenty-one people were detained on
OL,19,FTuesday after the arrival at Samphire
OL,20,FHoe.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
